mapping "W4678.1" source="W4678" target="821431000000102" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W4678 SNOMED CT 821431000000102 = Swedish national extension of W46 (Contact with hypodermic
        needle) adding agricultural-area + other-specified-activity detail; no international ICD-10 or
        SNOMED CT analogue for the place/activity subcategorization. Target SNOMED CT 44806406 (Hypodermic
        needle injury, concept_code 821431000000102) is the verified Athena crosswalk target for W46
        (concept_id 45756299). Target fully subsumes the source: every case of hypodermic needle contact
        in an agricultural setting is a hypodermic needle injury. broader (target subsumes source). High
        : verified Athena crosswalk at the W46 parent level with a one-level well-understood breadth
        mismatch (Swedish extension is more specific).
        """
}
